  #private;
  /** * Borrows port and captures client options once; options default to an empty object. clientId * defaults to main, with worker as the remote endpoint id. timeoutMs is omitted by default, * leaving requests without an application deadline. Invalid options throw locally; endpoint setup * failures surface through request/dispose rather than making the constructor async. */ constructor(
